# Safe Opener 2
Turns out to be very simple, but it didn't have to be.

This challenge asks the user to find the password using the provided file once again, however this time it uses a `.class` file. `.class` files are files for Java code which are compiled to run.

My first thought would be just to see what's inside with `cat` which provided a large output that makes the file very difficult to read, however everything we need is written in plaintext.
